msgid "Vector算子开发"
msgstr "Vector Operator Development"

msgid "Vector算子主要由Vector Core执行，典型形态包括逐元素计算、行级归约、类型转换、Gather/Scatter、Mask更新以及不含 `tl.dot` 的小型融合算子。开发重点不是把grid切得越细越好，而是在固定物理Vector Core数量的前提下，让每个program在核内循环处理多个tile。"
msgstr "The Vector Core mainly executes Vector operators. Typical forms include element-wise computation, row-level reduction, type conversion, Gather/Scatter, Mask updates, and small fusion operators that do not contain `tl.dot`. The development focus is not to split the grid as finely as possible. Instead, with a fixed number of physical Vector Cores, each program processes multiple tiles in a loop within the core."

msgid "Vector简单算子开发"
msgstr "Simple Vector Operator Development"

msgid "简单Vector算子可以从本仓的 [向量相加样例](../examples/01_vector_add_example.md) 或 [`third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py`](https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/blob/main/third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py) 入手。该类算子的基本步骤如下："
msgstr "For simple vector operators, start with the [vector addition sample](../examples/01_vector_add_example.md) or [`third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py`](https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/blob/main/third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py) in this repository. The basic steps for this type of operator are as follows:"

msgid "用 `tl.arange` 构造当前tile的连续偏移。"
msgstr "Use `tl.arange` to construct the contiguous offsets for the current tile."

msgid "用 `mask` 保护尾块，避免越界load/store。"
msgstr "Use `mask` to protect the tail block and avoid out-of-bounds load/store."

msgid "完成逐元素计算后写回结果。"
msgstr "Write back the result after completing the element-wise computation."

msgid "当grid数远大于物理核数时，将grid固定为 `num_vectorcore`，在kernel内用 `range(pid, num_blocks, num_core)` 分批处理。"
msgstr "When the number of grids is much larger than the number of physical cores, set the grid to `num_vectorcore`. Use `range(pid, num_blocks, num_core)` to process data in batches within the kernel."

msgid "基础kernel结构如下："
msgstr "The basic kernel structure is as follows:"

msgid ""
"@triton.jit\n"
"def add_kernel(x_ptr, y_ptr, out_ptr, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n"
"    num_core = tl.num_programs(0)\n"
"    num_blocks = tl.cdiv(n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"\n"
"    for block_idx in range(pid, num_blocks, num_core):\n"
"        offsets = block_idx * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"        mask = offsets < n_elements\n"
"        x = tl.load(x_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"        y = tl.load(y_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"        tl.store(out_ptr + offsets, x + y, mask=mask)\n"
msgstr ""
"@triton.jit\n"
"def add_kernel(x_ptr, y_ptr, out_ptr, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n"
"    num_core = tl.num_programs(0)\n"
"    num_blocks = tl.cdiv(n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"\n"
"    for block_idx in range(pid, num_blocks, num_core):\n"
"        offsets = block_idx * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"        mask = offsets < n_elements\n"
"        x = tl.load(x_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"        y = tl.load(y_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"        tl.store(out_ptr + offsets, x + y, mask=mask)\n"

msgid "开发时优先检查三类问题："
msgstr "During development, prioritize checking three types of issues:"

msgid "**数据类型**：Ascend Vector单元对不同整数类型的支持和性能不同。对于不影响精度的索引、长度、偏移类数据，优先使用 `int32`，可参考 [`001-vector_add.zh.md`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/basic/001-vector_add.zh.md) 和 [`002-vector_cmp.zh.md`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/basic/002-vector_cmp.zh.md)。"
msgstr "**Data type**: The Ascend Vector unit provides different levels of support and performance for different integer types. For index, length, and offset data that does not affect precision, prefer using `int32`. For more information, refer to [`001-vector_add.zh.md`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/basic/001-vector_add.zh.md) and [`002-vector_cmp.zh.md`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/basic/002-vector_cmp.zh.md)."

msgid "**BLOCK_SIZE**：BLOCK_SIZE需要在UB容量内尽量大。若出现UB overflow，先降低单次处理元素数，再考虑拆分子块。"
msgstr "**BLOCK_SIZE**: BLOCK_SIZE should be as large as possible within the UB capacity. If a UB overflow occurs, first reduce the number of elements processed at a time, and then consider splitting into sub-blocks."

msgid "**分核数**：NPU物理Vector Core数量通常为几十个。小tile大grid的GPU写法迁移到NPU时，容易因多轮下发带来明显开销。"
msgstr "**Number of cores**: An NPU typically has dozens of physical Vector Cores. When you migrate GPU-style code with small tiles and large grids to the NPU, multiple dispatch rounds can easily cause significant overhead."

msgid "Vector复杂算子开发"
msgstr "Complex Vector Operator Development"

msgid "复杂Vector算子通常不是单个逐元素表达式，而是带有离散访存、批量重排、多个输出或长hidden size的组合逻辑。可参考 [Ascend/triton-ascend-ops](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops) 中的以下案例："
msgstr "Complex Vector operators are typically not single element-wise expressions, but rather combined logic involving discrete memory access, batch reshuffling, multiple outputs, or long hidden sizes. Refer to the following examples in [Ascend/triton-ascend-ops](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops):"

msgid "[`tutorial/best_practice/004-gather_scatter.py`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/004-gather_scatter.py)：Megablocks gather/scatter/scatter_wgrad的Ascend亲和实现。"
msgstr "[`tutorial/best_practice/004-gather_scatter.py`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/004-gather_scatter.py): The Ascend-compatible implementation of Megablocks gather/scatter/scatter_wgrad."

msgid "[`tutorial/best_practice/005-binned_gather_scatter.py`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/005-binned_gather_scatter.py)：按expert/bin分组后的gather/scatter。"
msgstr "[`tutorial/best_practice/005-binned_gather_scatter.py`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/005-binned_gather_scatter.py): gather/scatter after grouping by expert/bin."

msgid "[`tutorial/best_practice/006-padded_gather_scatter.py`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/006-padded_gather_scatter.py)：带padding的MoE gather/scatter。"
msgstr "[`tutorial/best_practice/006-padded_gather_scatter.py`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/006-padded_gather_scatter.py): MoE gather/scatter with padding."

msgid "这类算子的组织方式通常是："
msgstr "This type of operator is typically organized as follows:"

msgid "**按物理核切分外层任务**：用 `num_vectorcore` 作为grid，每个program负责一段indices或token。"
msgstr "**Split outer tasks by physical core**: Use `num_vectorcore` as the grid, and each program handles a segment of indices or tokens."

msgid "**按UB容量切分hidden维**：对 `NUM_COLUMNS` 使用 `BLOCK_X` 分块，并预留double buffer、索引和临时张量的空间。"
msgstr "**Split the hidden dimension by UB capacity**: Tile `NUM_COLUMNS` using `BLOCK_X`, and reserve space for the double buffer, indices, and temporary tensors."

msgid "**用 `SUB_BLOCK_SIZE` 合并小粒度离散任务**：一次加载一组indices，在UB中组织成连续临时块，减少GM标量访存和多次store。"
msgstr "**Merging fine-grained discrete tasks using `SUB_BLOCK_SIZE`**: Load a group of indices at a time, organize them into contiguous temporary blocks in UB, and reduce GM scalar memory access and multiple stores."

msgid "**用扩展语义管理UB内局部数据**：先通过 `import triton.language.extra.cann.extension as extension` 引入扩展模块，再使用 `extension.insert_slice` 合并多行数据，使用 `extension.extract_slice` 取出子块后再分散写回。"
msgstr "**Managing local data in the UB using extension semantics**: First, import the extension module using `import triton.language.extra.cann.extension as extension`. Then, use `extension.insert_slice` to merge multiple rows of data, and use `extension.extract_slice` to extract a sub-block and write it back to scattered locations."

msgid "**为尾块保留统一mask**：复杂gather/scatter中同时存在index mask、column mask和expert/bin边界，建议分别命名并只在load/store处组合。"
msgstr "**Retain a unified mask for tail blocks**: In complex gather/scatter operations where index masks, column masks, and expert/bin boundaries coexist, name them separately and combine them only at load/store points."

msgid "典型的UB预算思路如下："
msgstr "The typical approach to UB budgeting is as follows:"

msgid ""
"# 获取NPU硬件属性，详见“通用多核任务并行”一节\n"
"import torch_npu\n"
"import triton.runtime.driver as driver\n"
"device = torch_npu.npu.current_device()\n"
"properties = driver.active.utils.get_device_properties(device)\n"
"num_core = properties[\"num_vectorcore\"]\n"
"\n"
"block_size = triton.cdiv(indices_length, num_core)\n"
"align_elems = 16\n"
"block_x = triton.cdiv(min(num_columns, max_block_x), align_elems) * align_elems\n"
"sub_block_size = max((ub_budget - block_x * element_bytes) //\n"
"                     (block_x * element_bytes + index_bytes), 1)\n"
msgstr ""
"# Get NPU hardware properties. For details, see the \"General Multi-Core Task Parallelism\" section\n"
"import torch_npu\n"
"import triton.runtime.driver as driver\n"
"device = torch_npu.npu.current_device()\n"
"properties = driver.active.utils.get_device_properties(device)\n"
"num_core = properties[\"num_vectorcore\"]\n"
"\n"
"block_size = triton.cdiv(indices_length, num_core)\n"
"align_elems = 16\n"
"block_x = triton.cdiv(min(num_columns, max_block_x), align_elems) * align_elems\n"
"sub_block_size = max((ub_budget - block_x * element_bytes) //\n"
"                     (block_x * element_bytes + index_bytes), 1)\n"

msgid "当复杂Vector算子性能不达预期时，优先从以下方向排查："
msgstr "When the performance of complex Vector operators does not meet expectations, prioritize troubleshooting from the following directions:"

msgid "grid是否远大于物理Vector Core数，导致多轮下发。"
msgstr "Whether the grid is significantly larger than the number of physical Vector Cores, causing multiple dispatch rounds."

msgid "离散访存是否可转化为“批量搬入UB后在UB内选择”。"
msgstr "Whether scattered memory access can be converted to \"batch loading into the UB and then selecting within the UB\"."

msgid "尾轴（最后一个维度）是否满足32B对齐；不满足时是否可用转置或借轴转置规避自动padding。"
msgstr "Check whether the tail axis (last dimension) is 32B-aligned; if not, check whether transpose or borrowed-axis transpose can avoid automatic padding."

msgid "`BLOCK_X` 和 `SUB_BLOCK_SIZE` 是否造成UB overflow或过小的搬运粒度。"
msgstr "Whether `BLOCK_X` and `SUB_BLOCK_SIZE` cause a UB overflow or an overly small data movement granularity."
